    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A small mistake on vacation can lead to big trouble. Are you ready for it? Are you ready to face the Beaver who\u2019s out for revenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Don't Mess With Bober</strong> \u2013 a first-person game with a touch of 80s horror movies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177010/extras/15d6afa9e1eb99bf13e945e8f4b8aced.poster.avif?t=1755203153\" width=616 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177010/extras/15d6afa9e1eb99bf13e945e8f4b8aced.webm?t=1755203153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>STORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of the city hustle, the main character heads to a countryside cabin to relax and unwind.<br>Get ready to face the consequences of a small misdeed that leads to serious trouble.<br>Dive into the mystery held by the river and the dam...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walking simulator with extra mechanics.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >River fishing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hide-and-seek and chase mechanics with the beaver</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177010/extras/c68152f881b99c0decf7773bc9262dac.poster.avif?t=1755203153\" width=616 height=331 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3177010/extras/c68152f881b99c0decf7773bc9262dac.webm?t=1755203153\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Good graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A beaver</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A walk in the fresh air (at least in the game)</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Playtime</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30\u201360 minutes</p>",
